Company Description:
Founded in 2003 by Doug Chertok, Vast Ventures is a venture capital fund that invests in Seed, Series A and growth stages. 

We are a manifesto-driven venture fund seeking world changing companies led by diverse founders who want to: 
Improve world-wide health and happiness;
Promote resource sustainability for future generations;
Increase human potential and productivity;
Increase knowledge, empathy and connectedness;
Disrupt industries that resist these goals.

A sample of sectors we invest in includes: 
Happiness & Consumer Brands;
AI & Cloud Software;
Finance, Insurance & Real Estate;
Resource Sustainability & Deep Tech;
Healthcare;
Food.

We have made over 70 investments including ASAPP, MOAT, Classpass, Ripple, Coinbase, Tala, Ginkgo Bioworks, Diamond Foundry, Clover Health, Zocdoc and SweetGreen.
